	| Description | This is the default customer role for accounts |
	| Name        | Default Account Customer Role                  |
	| Type        | Account Customer                               |
	And I create a contact role on koroneiki with the following values
	| Description | This is the optional customer role for accounts |
	| Name        | Optional Account Customer Role                  |
