	| Default Account Customer Role |
	And I assign the contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken" on the account "Koroneiki Automotive" to the following roles	
	| Optional Account Customer Role |
	And I create a product with the following values
	| Name | Liferay Digital Experience Platform | |
	And I generate static start and end dates
	And I create a product purchase for an account with the name "Koroneiki Automotive" and the product "Liferay Digital Experience Platform" on koroneiki with the following values
	| End Date                | ${staticEndDate}   |                |
	| Perpetual               | true               |                |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp1    | propertyValue1 |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp2    | propertyValue2 |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp3    | propertyValue3 |
	| Quantity                | 1                  |                |
	| Start Date              | ${staticStartDate} |                |
	And I create a contact entitlement definition related to the product purchase of the product "Liferay Digital Experience Platform" and contact role with the name "Default Account Customer Role" and type "Account Customer" with the following values
