	| Name        | Entitlement Name1        |
	| Status      | Approved                 |
	And I create a contact entitlement definition related to the product purchase of the product "Liferay Digital Experience Platform" and contact role with the name "Optional Account Customer Role" and type "Account Customer" with the following values
	| Description | Entitlement Description2 |
	| Name        | Entitlement Name2        |
	| Status      | Approved                 |
	Then the contact entitlement definition with the name "Entitlement Name1" should be present with the following values
	| Description | Entitlement Description1 |
	| Name        | Entitlement Name1        |
	| Status      | Approved                 |
