	| Description | Entitlement Description1 |
	| Name        | Entitlement Name1        |
	| Status      | Approved                 |
	And the contact entitlement definition with the name "Entitlement Name2" should be present with the following values
	| Description | Entitlement Description2 |
	| Name        | Entitlement Name2        |
	| Status      | Approved                 |
	And the contact entitlement definition with the name "Entitlement Name2" should be present via the entitlement definition key with the following values
	| Description | Entitlement Description2 |
	| Name        | Entitlement Name2        |
	| Status      | Approved                 |
