	And the entitlement from the entitlement definition "Entitlement Name2" should be visible via nested field on the contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken"

Scenario: Create multiple contact entitlements for customer contact based on product purchases
	Multiple koroneiki contact entitlements should be able to be created for a customer contact based on product purchases.

	Given I create an account on koroneiki with the following values
	| Code                  | KORAUTO                              | |
